REFERENCE           01KYK001
LANG_ENGLISH        "Kyle Katarn, at your service. Welcome to a day in the life of a Jedi. "

REFERENCE           01JAK008
LANG_ENGLISH        "What happened?"

REFERENCE           01KYK002
LANG_ENGLISH        "We were kind of hoping you could tell us."

REFERENCE           01ROP023
LANG_ENGLISH        "I saw a huge flash of light and ran over to find you just lying unconscious."

REFERENCE           01LUK004
LANG_ENGLISH        "Do you recall anything?"

REFERENCE           01JAK009
LANG_ENGLISH        "I... I saw three people. One was holding some sort of scepter and it was glowing. That's all I can remember."

